  "body": "Auction: 62 Highbrook Drive, East Tamaki on Wednesday 25 November 2026 at 1:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nViewing is essential, make St Heliers your next intelligent move! Our vendor is highly motivated and ready to make a deal — don’t miss out! \r\n\r\nThe beach, waterfront, parks and reserves are just a towel's flick from your door, blending the best of seaside living with city convenience. As one of Auckland’s premier destinations, St Heliers is celebrated for lifestyle and leisure — and from this solid standalone brick home on 440 sqm (m.o.l.) freehold land, you’re perfectly positioned to enjoy it all. \r\n\r\nWith a fully fenced yard secured with an automatic aluminium gate, this section has the potential for all your landscaping dreams. Perhaps a swimming pool, or space for dogs and children to play safely.\r\n\r\nFlexibility and comfort for every lifestyle. Come see how effortlessly it can adapt to yours, and make memories for years to come!\r\n\r\nCall Ken today to arrange your inspection.",
